<root><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Tibtle</title><link rel="stylesheet" href=""><body><div class="content"><div class="padding"><img src="" alt="+" /></div><div class="content_info"><div class="bread_crumps">/<a href="">Главная</a><div class="bread_crump">Терморегуляторы</div></div><div class="sidebar"><div class="slider-container"><div class="slider"><div class="slide active"><img src="" alt="Фото 1"><div class="slide active"><img src="" alt="Фото 1"><div class="slide active"><img src="" alt="Фото 1"><button class="prev" onclick="changeSlide(-1)">❮</button><button class="next" onclick="changeSlide(1)">❯</button><div class="dots-container"><span class="dot active" onclick="currentSlide(1)" /><span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(2)" /><span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(3)" /></div><script>let currentIndex = 0;
        const slides = document.querySelectorAll(".sidebar .slide");
        const dots = document.querySelectorAll(".sidebar .dot");

        function showSlide(index) {
            if (index &gt;= slides.length) {
                currentIndex = 0;
            } else if (index &lt; 0) {
                currentIndex = slides.length - 1;
            } else {
                currentIndex = index;
            }

            document.querySelector(".sidebar .slider").style.transform = `translateX(${-currentIndex * 100}%)`;

            dots.forEach(dot =&gt; dot.classList.remove("active"));
            dots[currentIndex].classList.add("active");
        }

        function changeSlide(direction) {
            showSlide(currentIndex + direction);
        }

        function currentSlide(index) {
            showSlide(index - 1);
        }

        setInterval(() =&gt; {
            changeSlide(1);
        }, 3000);</script><div style="margin: 10px 0;">Привет,  !</div><div class="header_actions"><form action="" method="post" style="display:inline;"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline">Выйти</button></form></div><div class="header_actions" style="margin: 10px 0;"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="">Войти</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="">Регистрация</a></div><div><div class="title">Терморегуляторы</div><div class="termoregulators"><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div /></div></a></div></div><div><div class="title">Основные категории продукции</div><div class="termoregulators"><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Нагревательные маты</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Нагревательный кабель в стяжку</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Тонкий нагревательный кабель</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Инфракрасная пленка</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Теплый пол под ламинат</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Терморегуляторы</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"><div>Система снеготаяния, обогрев труб и водостоков</div></div></a><a href="" class="thermoregulator"><img src="" alt="" class="img_termoregulator" /><div class="thermoregulator_descripton"